{"id":"torrey:access-to-god","source":"torrey","name":"Access To God","slug":"access-to-god","seeAlso":["Prayer","Repentance"],"entries":[{"text":"Is of God — Ps 65:4.","refs":[["Ps",65,4,65,4]]},{"text":"Is by Christ — Joh 10:7, 9; 14:6; Ro 5:2; Eph 2:13; 3:12; Heb 7:9, 25; 10:19; 1Pe 3:18.","refs":[["John",10,7,10,7],["John",10,9,10,9],["John",14,6,14,6],["Rom",5,2,5,2],["Eph",2,13,2,13],["Eph",3,12,3,12],["Heb",7,9,7,9],["Heb",7,25,7,25],["Heb",10,19,10,19],["1Pet",3,18,3,18]]},{"text":"Is by the Holy Spirit — Eph 2:18.","refs":[["Eph",2,18,2,18]]},{"text":"Obtained through faith — Ac 14:27; Ro 5:2; Eph 3:12; Heb 11:6.","refs":[["Acts",14,27,14,27],["Rom",5,2,5,2],["Eph",3,12,3,12],["Heb",11,6,11,6]]},{"text":"Follows upon reconciliation to God — Col 1:21,22.","refs":[["Col",1,21,1,21],["Col",1,22,1,22]]},{"text":"In Prayer — See Prayer. De 4:7; Mt 6:6; 1Pe 1:17.","refs":[["Deut",4,7,4,7],["Matt",6,6,6,6],["1Pet",1,17,1,17]]},{"text":"In his temple — Ps 15:1; 27:4; 43:3; 65:4.","refs":[["Ps",15,1,15,1],["Ps",27,4,27,4],["Ps",43,3,43,3],["Ps",65,4,65,4]]},{"text":"To obtain mercy and grace — Heb 4:16.","refs":[["Heb",4,16,4,16]]},{"text":"A privilege of saints — De 4:7; Ps 15:1; 23:6; 24:3,4.","refs":[["Deut",4,7,4,7],["Ps",15,1,15,1],["Ps",23,6,23,6],["Ps",24,3,24,3],["Ps",24,4,24,4]]},{"text":"Saints have, with confidence — Eph 3:12; Heb 4:16; 10:19,20.","refs":[["Eph",3,12,3,12],["Heb",4,16,4,16],["Heb",10,19,10,19],["Heb",10,20,10,20]]},{"text":"Vouchsafed to repenting sinners — See Repentance. Ho 14:2; Joe 2:12.","refs":[["Hos",14,2,14,2],["Joel",2,12,2,12]]},{"text":"Saints earnestly seek — Ps 27:4; 42:1,2; 43:3; 84:1,2.","refs":[["Ps",27,4,27,4],["Ps",42,1,42,1],["Ps",42,2,42,2],["Ps",43,3,43,3],["Ps",84,1,84,1],["Ps",84,2,84,2]]},{"text":"The wicked commanded to seek — Isa 55:6; Jas 4:8.","refs":[["Isa",55,6,55,6],["Jas",4,8,4,8]]},{"text":"Urge others to seek — Isa 2:3; Jer 31:6.","refs":[["Isa",2,3,2,3],["Jer",31,6,31,6]]},{"text":"Promises connected with — Ps 145:18; Isa 55:3; Mt 6:6; Jas 4:8.","refs":[["Ps",145,18,145,18],["Isa",55,3,55,3],["Matt",6,6,6,6],["Jas",4,8,4,8]]},{"text":"Blessedness connected with — Ps 16:11; 65:4; 73:28.","refs":[["Ps",16,11,16,11],["Ps",65,4,65,4],["Ps",73,28,73,28]]},{"text":"Typified — Le 16:12-15; Heb 10:19-22.","refs":[["Lev",16,12,16,15],["Heb",10,19,10,22]]},{"text":"Moses. — Ex 24:2; 34:4-7.","refs":[["Exod",24,2,24,2],["Exod",34,4,34,7]]}],"refCount":58}
